{"seq":59,"slug":"synthetic-data-generation","title":"合成数据生成","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation","rating":{"composite":3.82,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"合成数据生成\">合成数据生成</h1><p>真实数据正在成为人工智能最稀缺的原材料。高质量的公开文本被前沿模型反复抓取后趋于枯竭，医疗与金融领域的个人数据被法规牢牢锁住，而长尾场景里那些罕见却致命的边界情况，恰恰是采集成本最高的样本。合成数据生成，就是用算法「制造」出统计性质或语义内容接近真实、却不直接复制任何真实个体的数据，来填补这些缺口。它不是真实数据的廉价替身，而是一种可以被设计、被审计、被精确控制隐私与覆盖度的新型数据资产。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 沿着「为什么 → 怎么做 → 如何度量 → 怎么落地」四条主线层层递进。第一章「基础」回答最根本的问题：我们究竟为何需要合成数据，它有哪些类型与谱系，以及贯穿全程的核心张力——保真度与隐私之间不可兼得的权衡。理解了这层张力，后面所有方法与评估的取舍才有坐标系。</p>\n<p>第二章「生成方法」是技术主干，按表达能力从弱到强排开三类路线：基于规则与仿真的确定性方法，给你完全可控但难以捕捉真实复杂性的数据；以 GAN、VAE、扩散模型为代表的深度生成模型，用神经网络学习分布；以及 2023 年以来彻底改变格局的 LLM 驱动合成与蒸馏，让模型用自然语言指令大规模「写出」训练样本。</p>\n<p>第三章「表格与隐私」把镜头对准结构化数据这一工业界最常见、也最受合规约束的战场。表格数据合成有其专属模型谱系，差分隐私则为「不泄露任何个体」提供了可证明的数学保证，而评估保真与效用告诉你如何用 TSTR、成员推断攻击等手段量化「这批合成数据到底好不好、安不安全」。</p>\n<p>第四章「工程实践」收束到真实生产中的三个高频用途：用合成数据做训练增强、构造干净不污染的评测集，以及必须时刻警惕的风险——当模型反复吃自己的输出，会陷入「模型崩溃」的退化漩涡。读完全 hub，你应当能为一个具体场景独立判断：该不该用合成数据、用哪条方法、如何评估、又该如何避开陷阱。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-synthetic-data","title":"为何需要合成数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/foundations/why-synthetic-data"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-types-spectrum","title":"类型与谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/foundations/data-types-spectrum"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fidelity-privacy-tradeoff","title":"保真度与隐私的权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/foundations/fidelity-privacy-tradeoff"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"methods","title":"生成方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rule-based-simulation","title":"基于规则与仿真","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/methods/rule-based-simulation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"generative-models","title":"生成模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/methods/generative-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"llm-driven-generation","title":"LLM 驱动的合成与蒸馏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/methods/llm-driven-generation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"tabular-privacy","title":"表格与隐私","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/tabular-privacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tabular-synthesis","title":"表格数据合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/tabular-privacy/tabular-synthesis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"differential-privacy-synthesis","title":"差分隐私合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/tabular-privacy/differential-privacy-synthesis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"evaluation-fidelity-utility","title":"评估保真与效用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/tabular-privacy/evaluation-fidelity-utility"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"training-augmentation","title":"训练数据增强","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/practice/training-augmentation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"benchmark-construction","title":"评测集构造","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/practice/benchmark-construction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"risks-model-collapse","title":"风险与模型崩溃","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/practice/risks-model-collapse"}]}]}